      "title": "Speed",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "R2 speeds recorded before 2026-10-14 are unreliable: the app read GPS speed from the wrong field (fixed upstream in 3beec46). Positions and distances are fine. Drives from 2026-10-15 (drive #29 on) read correctly; older ones stay wrong."
